{"rpid": "5404420517", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "-喵呜喵呜喵呜喵", "mid": "42219034", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "《Over the Rainbow》\nSomewhere over the rainbow, way up high\n在彩虹之上的某个地方，一路高\nThere's a land that I heard of once in a lullaby\n有一块乐土，我曾在摇篮曲中听到\nSomewhere over the rainbow, skies are blue\n在彩虹之上的某个地方，天空是蔚蓝的\nAnd the dreams that you dare to dream really do come true\n只要你敢做的梦，梦想真的会成真\nSomeday I'll wish upon a star\n有一天我会对着星星许愿\nAnd wake up where the clouds are far behind me\n醒来发觉云远天\nWhere troubles melt like lemon drops\n在那里烦恼像柠檬糖一样融化\nAway above the chimney tops\n远离烟囱的顶端\nThat's where you'll find me\n你会发现我就在那\nSomewhere over the rainbow, bluebirds fly\n在彩虹之上的某个地方，青鸟悠然飞翔\nBirds fly over the rainbow\n鸟儿飞越彩虹\nWhy then, oh why can't I?\n为什么，噢，为什么我不能？\nIf happy little bluebirds fly beyond the rainbow\n如果快乐的小青鸟儿飞过了彩虹\nWhy, oh why can't I?\n为什么，噢，为什么我不能？", "like": 3, "ctime": 1631720065, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "368647", "video_bvid": "BV1Bx411F7aE", "video_title": "穿越彩虹~Over The Rainbow", "video_desc": "新浪 搬运~觉得很经典就放上来了~", "video_owner": "我还真忘了叫什么了", "video_view": 4956, "video_reply": 12, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 1}
